              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"f6748df0d4de26f49422228d0203ddadffbfbf29ca6abc0b23d938ebd9a534bb\" kind=\"text\" label=\"communication evidence\">\n08 April 2025\n10:12 Mira: Hi, mujhe do brass lotus candle holders chahiye, matte finish mein. Can you ship to France?\n10:15 Kavya: Haan, dono handmade hain. Goods aur shipping mila kar EUR 86 hoga.\n10:18 Mira: EUR 86 total theek hai. Please make sure both holders have the matte finish.\n10:21 Kavya: Done. Main PayPal payment ke baad packing karungi aur postal tracking bhejungi.\n10:24 Mira: Great, please send the invoice. Delivery details main separately share kar dungi.\n10:26 Kavya: Sure, invoice abhi bhejti hoon. Thank you!\n</evidence>"
